          "title": "账户列表",
          "platform": "desktop",
          "markup": "<main class=\"admin-page\"><aside>设置中心</aside><section><header><h2>账户管理</h2><button>新建账户</button></header><div class=\"stats\"><strong>28</strong><span>活跃账户</span></div><table><thead><tr><th>姓名</th><th>角色</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>林小满</td><td>管理员</td><td>正常</td></tr><tr><td>周景</td><td>运营</td><td>正常</td></tr></tbody></table><a href=\"A02.html\">打开账户详情</a></section></main>",
          "styles": ".admin-page{display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px 1fr;min-height:720px;background:#f6f8fb}.admin-page aside{padding:30px;background:#172033;color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:800}.admin-page section{padding:36px}.admin-page header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.admin-page button,.admin-page>a{padding:11px 16px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;text-decoration:none}.stats{width:240px;margin:28px 0;padding:22px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff}.stats strong,.stats span{display:block}.stats strong{font-size:32px}table{width:100%;margin-bottom:30px;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff}th,td{padding:16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:left}",
